[53.355, "o", "The **Google BigQuery Managed MCP Server** (`urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery`) \u2014 it executes live SQL queries, inspects schemas, and estimates query costs via dry runs.\r\n\r\nOne caveat: it's Tier 3 (GCP ADC required), and you're not currently authenticated (no gcloud/ADC). You'd need to run `gcloud auth application-default login` first. Your 100GB dataset also fits comfortably in BigQuery's free tier (1TB query/month).\r\n\r\nThe **BigQuery SQL & Performance Guidelines skill** (Tier 0, no auth) is a no-auth fallback for query optimization help, but it can't run queries itself.\r\n"]
