[93.022, "o", "The **Google BigQuery Managed MCP Server** (`urn:ai:google.com:mcp:bigquery`) \u2014 it executes SQL queries, inspects schemas, and explores public datasets directly.\r\n\r\nNote: it requires GCP auth (Tier 3), but your system currently has no gcloud/credentials. Setup is `gcloud auth application-default login` (free tier includes 1TB/month of query processing).\r\n\r\nAlternative without auth: the **BigQuery SQL & Performance Guidelines skill** (Tier 0) for writing/optimizing queries, or use the public BigQuery REST API directly with an API key.\r\n"]
