[108.252, "o", "There's no Google Cloud login available yet on this system:\r\n\r\n- `gcloud` CLI is **not installed**\r\n- No active service account or user ADC credentials\r\n- No API keys set\r\n\r\nTo log in, you'd need to install the Google Cloud CLI first. Want me to check if `gcloud` can be installed here, or do you have a service account key you'd like to use instead?\r\n"]
