[114.431, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[114.49, "o", "================================================================================\r\n\ud83d\ude80 LAUNCHING OPENCODE REAL AGENT E2E TEST RUNNER\r\n\u2022 Container Image: localhost/ard-opencode:latest\r\n\u2022 Repo Path:       /usr/local/google/home/alanblount/Workspaces/open-source/ard-plugin-exploration\r\n================================================================================\r\n\r\n================================================================================\r\n"]
[114.49, "o", "\ud83e\uddea SCENARIO 1: Pure Public Discovery (Tier 0 Zero-Auth Counterpoint)\r\n================================================================================\r\n"]
[128.305, "o", "Found relevant tools. Best matches:\r\n\r\n**SQL query optimization**\r\n- `urn:ai:google.com:skills:bigquery-guidelines` \u2014 SQL optimization, partitioning/clustering, window functions, schema design (Tier 0, ready)\r\n- `urn:ai:google.com:skills:database-design` \u2014 Cloud SQL/AlloyDB/Spanner: normalization, columnar indexing, connection pooling (Tier 0, ready)\r\n- `urn:ai:google.com:skills:well-architected-cost-optimization` \u2014 BigQuery slot & query pricing optimization (Tier 0)\r\n\r\n**Zero-trust security**\r\n- `urn:ai:google.com:skills:well-architected-security` \u2014 Zero-trust patterns, IAM least privilege, network perimeters, encryption (Tier 0, ready)\r\n\r\nAll top matches are Tier 0 \u2014 no auth or GCP setup required. Want me to pull the actual best-practice content from any of these skill docs?\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n> build \u00b7 deepseek-v4-flash-free\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"SQL query optimization best practices database performance tuning\"}\r\n\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"zero-trust security architecture best practices access control\"}\r\n\r\n\u2705 Scenario 1 Passed: OpenCode returned Tier 0 skills with zero auth friction.\r\n\r\n================================================================================\r\n\ud83e\uddea SCENARIO 2: Cloud Intent -> User Opts Out ('No with an opt out')\r\n================================================================================\r\n"]
[131.031, "o", "e"]
[131.071, "o", "x"]
[131.112, "o", "i"]
[131.152, "o", "t"]
[131.592, "o", "\r\n"]
